<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets C$100 million Dec 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets C$100 million Dec 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion and Bayer Hypo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8475   PAY DATE   S13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.66     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT BOND DUE 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
